{"seq":1,"slug":"reception-and-misuse","title":"接受与误用","docCount":2,"url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/claude-shannon/controversies-and-appraisal/reception-and-misuse","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"the-overextension-of-entropy","title":"信息熵的过度引申","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/claude-shannon/controversies-and-appraisal/reception-and-misuse/the-overextension-of-entropy","wordCount":1638,"readingTime":7},{"seq":2,"slug":"an-underappreciated-figure","title":"一位被低估的人物","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/claude-shannon/controversies-and-appraisal/reception-and-misuse/an-underappreciated-figure","wordCount":1334,"readingTime":6}],"introHtml":"<h1 id=\"接受与误用\">接受与误用</h1><p>本章客观地呈现信息论在接受过程中的现象。&quot;信息熵&quot;概念曾被一些人过度引申与误用；而相对于其伟大的贡献，香农在公众中却是一位被低估的人物。两篇文档，分别呈现信息熵的过度引申，以及一位被低估的人物，力求客观而全面。</p>\n"}